  "markdown": "251\n\n[seal: GREAT SEAL OF THE STATE OF IDAHO]\n\n# **CERTIFICATE OF ORGANIZATION LIMITED LIABILITY COMPANY**\n\nTitle 30, Chapters 21 and 25, Idaho Code\n\nBase Filing fee: $100.00 typed, $120 not typed\n\n**Complete and submit the application in <u>duplicate</u>.**\n\n[stamp: FILED EFFECTIVE]\n\n[stamp: 2018 APR -9 PM 2:51 SECRETARY OF STATE STATE OF IDAHO]\n\n1. **The name of the limited liability company is**: CAPITAL ASSET REALTY, LLC\n(Remember to include the words \"Limited Liability Company,\" \"Limited Company,\" or the abbreviations L.L.C., LLC, or LC)\n\n2. **The complete street and mailing addresses of the principal office is**:\n- **(Street Address)**: 6734 N. MADELLAINE DRIVE, COEUR D'ALENE, ID. 83815\n- **(Mailing Address, if different)**: P.O. BOX 790 COEUR D'ALENE, ID 83816\n\n3. **The name and complete street address of the registered agent**:\n- **(Name)**: John W. Keighley, III\n- **(Address)**: 6734 N. Madellaine, Dr. Coeur d'Alene, ID 838915\n\n4. **The name and address of at least one governor of the limited liability company**:\n- **(Name)**: John W. Keighley, III\n- **(Address)**: 6734 N. Madellaine Dr. Coeur d'Alene, ID 83815\n- **(Name)**: John W. Keighley, Jr.\n- **(Address)**: 6734 N. Madellaine Dr. Coeur d'Alene, ID 83815\n- **(Name)**: [blank]\n- **(Address)**: [blank]\n- **(Name)**: [blank]\n- **(Address)**: [blank]\n\n5. **Mailing address for future correspondence (annual report notices)**: P.O. Box 790 Coeur d'Alene, ID 83816\n(Address)\n\nSignature of organizer(s).\nPrinted Name: John W. Keighley, III\nSignature: [signature]\nPrinted Name: John W. Keighley, Jr.\nSignature: [signature]\nRev. 01/2018\n\nSecretary of State use only\nIDAHO SECRETARY OF STATE\n04/09/2018 05:00\nCK:1753 CT:355915 BH:1637131\n1@ 100.00 = 100.00 ORGAN LLC #2\n1@ 20.00 = 20.00 EXPEDITE C #3\n[signature]\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m7rtgcvpbws9xt87es3ksmrh -->",
